  "frozenInvariants": [
    "Evidence Gate PASS means evidence sufficiency, not performance pass.",
    "Frozen EvidencePackage uses manifest snapshots, never mutable current ontology state.",
    "Formal Run freezes model assembly, environment/federation, readiness, control, event reconstruction, data quality and automated adjudication provenance.",
    "Machine adjudication is immutable; human review adds a separate final disposition and cannot edit machine facts in place.",
    "Legacy Runs are not retroactively upgraded with provenance fields.",
    "Model execution plane (FMI/SAL/IDL/LVC) remains separate from T&E ontology control plane."
  ],
